OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FChangeable, with periods of rain on
OL,7,FWednesday. Eventually drier and
OL,8,Fbrighter on Thursday after early rain.
OL,9,FLargely dry Friday but a chance of
OL,10,Fshowers. Temperatures a little below
OL,11,Fnormal.
